# The VSIX holds only what VS Code loads: the bundle (its dependencies are
# inlined, hence --no-dependencies), the declarative parts, the Open VSX
# page and, in a platform VSIX, the release binary under bin/.
**
!dist/extension.js
!language-configuration.json
!syntaxes/*.tmLanguage.json
!snippets/*.code-snippets
!images/icon.png
!bin/sigil
!bin/sigil.exe
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
